      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.7.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.7.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said unto Moses, See, I have made thee a god to Pharaoh: and Aaron thy brother shall be thy prophet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt speak all that I command thee: and Aaron thy brother shall speak unto Pharaoh, that he send the children of Israel out of his land.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will harden Pharaoh's heart, and multiply my signs and my wonders in the land of Egypt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Pharaoh shall not hearken unto you, that I may lay my hand upon Egypt, and bring forth mine armies,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.7.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.7.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my people the children of Israel, out of the land of Egypt by great judgments.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the Egyptians shall know that I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.7.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.7.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.7.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.7.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", when I stretch forth mine hand upon Egypt, and bring out the children of Israel from among them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Moses and Aaron did as the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.7.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.7.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "commanded them, so did they.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Moses",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.7.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.7.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fourscore years old, and Aaron fourscore and three years old, when they spake unto Pharaoh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.7.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.7.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "spake unto Moses and unto Aaron, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Pharaoh shall speak unto you, saying, Shew a miracle for you: then thou shalt say unto Aaron, Take thy rod, and cast",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.7.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.7.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "before Pharaoh,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.7.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.7.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "it shall become a serpent.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And Moses and Aaron went in unto Pharaoh, and they did so as the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.7.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.7.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "had commanded: and Aaron cast down his rod before Pharaoh, and before his servants, and it became a serpent.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Pharaoh also called the wise men and the sorcerers: now the magicians of Egypt, they also did in like manner with their enchantments.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For they cast down every man his rod, and they became serpents: but Aaron's rod swallowed up their rods.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he hardened Pharaoh's heart, that he hearkened not unto them; as the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.7.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.7.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "had said.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.7.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.7.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said unto Moses, Pharaoh's heart",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.7.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.7.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hardened, he refuseth to let the people go.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Get thee unto Pharaoh in the morning; lo, he goeth out unto the water; and thou shalt stand by the river's brink against he come; and the rod which was turned to a serpent shalt thou take in thine hand.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt say unto him, The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.7.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.7.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God of the Hebrews hath sent me unto thee, saying, Let my people go, that they may serve me in the wilderness: and, behold, hitherto thou wouldest not hear.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.7.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.7.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", In this thou shalt know that I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.7.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.7.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.7.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.7.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": behold, I will smite with the rod that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.7.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.7.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in mine hand upon the waters which",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.7.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.7.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the river, and they shall be turned to blood.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the fish that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
